post_install() {
  cat <<EOF

Run the daemon with:   systemctl enable --now ollaya
Or use the CLI directly: ollaya pull laya && ollaya run laya --preset triage "..."

On NVIDIA GPUs (driver R580+ with CUDA 13), GPU acceleration needs the CUDA
provider libraries, which upstream ships separately (ollaya-linux-amd64-cuda.tar.zst,
about 1 GB) and installs into /usr/lib/ollaya/cuda_v13. This package ships the
CPU binary only.

EOF
}
